# Bootable message catalog: French (fr).
# STATUS: machine-quality draft; needs review by a native speaker.
# Keys and placeholders must match en.lang; missing keys fall back to English.
# Typography note: plain spaces are used before ; : ! ? (no NBSP) so terminal
# layouts wrap predictably; a native reviewer may prefer U+202F / U+00A0.

